'''No Stage Fright''' (舞台の上では平気なの, ''Butai no Ue dewa Heiki Nano'', '''I'm Fine on Stage''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]].

==Effect==
"Resistant" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

