==Trivia==
*No Stage Fright's Japanese name, ''Butai no Ue de wa Heikinano'' ("I'm Fine on Stage"), is a reference to "Kōto no naka dewa heiki nano" ("In the court I feel just fine"), a lyric from the [https://youtu.be/7zoXXfBxXG0 opening] to the anime [[wikipedia:Attack No. 1|''Attack No. 1'']].

